# Optional product-surface gates. This lean set is also the code default:
# Live Ticks, Momentum and History remain active; the listed experimental
# screens stop fetching, computing and writing data. Use an empty value to
# re-enable every component, or remove individual slugs as needed.
# "faders" is accepted as an alias for "continuation".
